relevant-sections.section:
Single source of truth for tool names: ```typescript export const TOOL_NAMES = [ 'memory', 'search_slack_messages', 'execute_code', 'web_search', 'mcp_call', ] as const;
export type ToolName = typeof TOOL_NAMES[number]; ```
Tool handlers registered via `toolHandlers: Record<ToolName, ToolHandler>`
